Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='rustlanguage', at=datetime(2026, 9, 8, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='The language is Rust; the Python is gone', body="over clever. Tools pinned in the flake (`.#triage` is the operator env).\n*The language is Rust* (2026-09-08, ARCHITECTURE §8.6; the Python is gone). Every crate is `#![forbid(unsafe_code)]`; clippy `pedantic` at `-D warnings` over `--all-targets`; `missing_docs` warns (a public item with no doc comment is a rule not written down); typed errors per crate (`thiserror`), `anyhow` only at the binary's edge, never in a library; rustls, never OpenSSL, and ONE of it. `cargo fmt --check` and clippy gate rustls, never OpenSSL, and ONE of it. `cargo fmt --check` and clippy gate the merge gate and CI.", rationale='Decided 2026-09-08 (ARCHITECTURE §8.6), when the application was ported from Python to Rust and the Python was deleted.', supersedes=()))